 "about": "mod-puzzles against the built package dungeon instead of the mods' source folders (tools/make_package_scenarios.py). mods/puzzles: HoH1's Constellation (tools/make_constellation.py). Fabricated in town, a random pattern is picked (7-12 stars); pressing the non-pattern stars fails it on the first one and locks every star. Fabricated again on a mission floor, pressing exactly the pattern stars solves it (remaining 0, solved ran once, stars locked). usews presses a star only while its correct/wrong link is enabled, so the static steps follow the random pattern. Then no script errors in our files.",
